| Frontend, UI, or rendering-layer work | {{CONTENT_DIR}}/architecture.md, {{CONTENT_DIR}}/frontend.md |
| Database or query work | {{CONTENT_DIR}}/architecture.md, {{CONTENT_DIR}}/database.md |
| Authentication or security-sensitive work | {{CONTENT_DIR}}/architecture.md, {{CONTENT_DIR}}/security.md |
